{"slug":"/references/product/listAndCountProductVariants","title":"listAndCountProductVariants - Product Module Reference","frontmatter":{"displayed_sidebar":"productReference","slug":"/references/product/listAndCountProductVariants","sidebar_label":"listAndCountProductVariants"},"toc":[{"title":"Example","id":"example","level":2},{"title":"Parameters","id":"listandcountproductvariants-parameters","level":2},{"title":"Returns","id":"listandcountproductvariants-returns","level":2}],"blocks":[{"kind":"markdown","html":"This documentation provides a reference to the `listAndCountProductVariants` method. This belongs to the Product Module."},{"kind":"note","variant":"note","html":"You should only use this methods when implementing complex customizations. For common cases, check out [available workflows instead](/medusa-workflows-reference)."},{"kind":"markdown","html":"This method is used to retrieve a paginated list of product variants along with the total count of available product variants satisfying the provided filters."},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"text":"Example","id":"example"},{"kind":"markdown","html":"To retrieve a list of product variants using their IDs:\n\n```ts\nconst [variants, count] =\n  await productModuleService.listAndCountProductVariants({\n    id: [\"variant_123\", \"variant_321\"],\n  })\n```\n\nTo specify relations that should be retrieved within the product variants:"},{"kind":"note","variant":"note","html":"You can only retrieve data models defined in the same module. To retrieve linked data models\nfrom other modules, use [Query](https://docs.medusajs.com/learn/fundamentals/module-links/query) instead."},{"kind":"markdown","html":"```ts\nconst [variants, count] =\n  await productModuleService.listAndCountProductVariants(\n    {\n      id: [\"variant_123\", \"variant_321\"],\n    },\n    {\n      relations: [\"options\"],\n    }\n  )\n```\n\nBy default, only the first `15` records are retrieved. You can control pagination by specifying the `skip` and `take` properties of the `config` parameter:\n\n```ts\nconst [variants, count] =\n  await productModuleService.listAndCountProductVariants(\n    {\n      id: [\"variant_123\", \"variant_321\"],\n    },\n    {\n      relations: [\"options\"],\n      take: 20,\n      skip: 2,\n    }\n  )\n```"},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"text":"Parameters","id":"listandcountproductvariants-parameters"},{"kind":"typeList","sectionTitle":"listAndCountProductVariants","types":[{"name":"filters","type":"[FilterableProductVariantProps](/references/product/interfaces/product.FilterableProductVariantProps)","description":"The filters applied on the retrieved product variants.","optional":true,"defaultValue":"","expandable":false,"children":[{"name":"$and","type":"([FilterableProductVariantProps](/references/product/interfaces/product.FilterableProductVariantProps) \\| [BaseFilterable](/references/product/interfaces/product.BaseFilterable)&#60;[FilterableProductVariantProps](/references/product/interfaces/product.FilterableProductVariantProps)&#62;)[]","description":"An array of filters to apply on the entity, where each item in the array is joined with an \"and\" condition.","optional":true,"defaultValue":"","expandable":false,"children":[{"name":"$and","type":"([FilterableProductVariantProps](/references/product/interfaces/product.FilterableProductVariantProps) \\| [BaseFilterable](/references/product/interfaces/product.BaseFilterable)&#60;[FilterableProductVariantProps](/references/product/interfaces/product.FilterableProductVariantProps)&#62;)[]","description":"An array of filters to apply on the entity, where each item in the array is joined with an \"and\" condition.","optional":true,"defaultValue":"","expandable":false,"children":[]},{"name":"$or","type":"([FilterableProductVariantProps](/references/product/interfaces/product.FilterableProductVariantProps) \\| [BaseFilterable](/references/product/interfaces/product.BaseFilterable)&#60;[FilterableProductVariantProps](/referen